---
globs:
  - "artifacts/**/*.json"
  - "workflow/**/*.md"
alwaysApply: true
---

An approval is valid only for the exact content hash, selected variant, asset IDs, and Page ID shown to the reviewer. Any edit creates a new version and invalidates approval. AI may prepare `NEEDS_HUMAN_APPROVAL`; only an authenticated reviewer/backend may create `APPROVED`. In chat mode, the authenticated human's explicit reply is recorded verbatim; the agent must never infer approval or choose option 1.
